WEBVTT

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:27.880
Hm?

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:37.560
The bar soap...
and hand soap are almost out.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:40.940
I guess I'll stop by a drug store...

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.350
...if I remember.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:46.230
Good morning!

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:50.320
So... together with the kids,
use balls here, and-- Ah!

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.530
Good morning!

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:54.700
Uramichi Oniisan. This is for you.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:56.780
"Man Who Causes a Snowstorm"
"Together with Maman"

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.910
It's the costume design
for the new segment today.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.580
Good morning!

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.580
Good morning!

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.830
Good morning!

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.670
Oh! Iketeru Oniisan!

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:06.500
Hm?

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.170
This is the costume design for you.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.680
This is...!

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:20.770
I'll do it to stay alive!

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:22.900
He rationalized it in such an extreme way.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:53.610
"Life Lessons with Uramichi Oniisan"

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:57.110
Episode 3: Wash Your Hands and Gargle

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:01.030
Hello, kids! How are you?!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.370
Hello!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.330
You sound very energetic.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.250
As for me...

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.750
My stomach hurts so much
for some reason. I wonder why...

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:12.840
Ow!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:12.920
Bonk

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.880
Are you okay, Utano Oneesan?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:20.890
Could it be because you ate a snack
without washing your hands earlier?

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.350
Yeah, I think that's the reason.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.430
Didn't Usao-<i>kun </i>just hit his pinky toe?

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:27.190
I wonder what we should do
in a time like this?

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.190
Yep, he did.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:29.860
I have an idea! Let's have someone

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:33.820
beat up the misbehaving bacteria
in Utano Oneesan's stomach.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.520
It looks like he's still in pain.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.820
I feel sorry for him.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:36.650
Yeah... but who?

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:39.660
Kids! Let's call out to him loudly!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:40.870
One, two...!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.410
Jerminator!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.540
You called?

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.920
When it comes to eliminating bacteria,
leave it to me, Jerminator!

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.420
Jerminator
(Iketeru Oniisan)

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.260
Jerminator!

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:57.760
You came for me.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:58.590
Hm?

00:03:58.590 --> 00:03:59.840
Who's there?!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:04.430
Eliminating bacteria
while I'm not around?!

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.930
I won't let you do that, Jerminator!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:11.900
I, Bacterian, will defeat you
for sure, today!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.230
Bacterian
(Uramichi Oniisan)

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.820
There you are, Bacterian!

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:20.320
You're the one who will be defeated!
Give me sanitizing soap bubbles!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:20.900
"Rattle, rattle, rattle..."
"Soap Bubbles"

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:21.570
Take this!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:21.990
Ow!

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.580
Ah...

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:32.130
I think... your aim
is a little... too good.

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:34.420
I am... very sorry.

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.340
You can't hurt me with
a puny attack like that.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:40.470
Seems like it really hurt, though.

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:41.680
So, it didn't work...

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:41.680
Yep, sure does.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.970
He got him right in the face.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.970
Kids! Help me beat him!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:45.890
Here you go.

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:47.810
Thank you!

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:49.440
Is it okay to throw it at him?

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.480
Throw it as hard as you can!
Really hard, okay?

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:04.950
The power you kids have isn't enough
to beat me, Jermi--err, Bacterian!

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.570
He said the wrong name.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:05.030
Whisper

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:04.950
Yep, he did.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.830
Now, come at me with all you got!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.960
Darn you kids, you really got me!

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:21.380
You can tell he's a nice guy when you
see how he goes out of his way

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:24.260
to get hit on purpose.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.390
Okay then!

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:28.720
I'll finish you off,
Jermi--err, Bacterian!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.270
He said the wrong name, too!

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:31.560
They sure mess up a lot.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.850
Take this!

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:38.110
Ow! I'm... going... to...

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:39.610
Let me speak.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.400
I'm going to cut you a break today!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.530
Farewell!

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:44.990
Kids, thank you!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:49.410
Because you defeated the bacteria,
my stomachache is gone.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:52.620
Starting today, don't forget
to wash your hands and gargle!

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.880
And they lived happily ever after.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.040
Okay, cut!

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.670
That's good!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.750
Green Room
for Uramichi
 Omota-sama

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.720
I'm sorry, Uramichi Oniisan.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:06.390
I came because I heard that you
became a polka-dot Oniisan.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:10.520
This is a children's show. You didn't
have to go full power, you know.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.390
But anyway, you should knock first.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.650
I'm sorry. It's a habit from
the time I was in a theater group.

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:18.320
Whenever I get into character,
I'm unable to hold back.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.820
Is that a character you can get into?

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:25.110
I wonder if we're gonna
keep on doing that segment.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.530
I don't know.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.410
I hope it's not popular.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:31.870
We just look like two weirdos
playing with balls.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.210
Yeah.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:37.370
{=0}Loxonun Tape

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.170
The compress on your back
is totally messed up.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:37.290
Yeah.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.130
What're you saying?

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:41.420
Seriously!

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:44.930
If you go to Uramichi-<i>san</i>'s place, you'll
always hit your pinky toe on dumbbells,

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.930
so, it'll die for sure!

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:49.010
It's like he's letting
the dumbbells roam free.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.140
I think we're living in an era where

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.730
a funny guy would be more popular
than a good-looking gym rat like him!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:55.350
Ah...

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.690
Oh, I wanna be funn--

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.140
"Wanna Quit Bunny"

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:57.560
Usahara.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:58.860
Yes, sir! Ow!

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:05.280
The nickname "polka-dot Oniisan"
isn't the slightest bit funny.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.990
How...

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.330
...does he know I came up with that?

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:18.540
In any case, there are simpler ways
to teach kids how important

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.750
washing their hands and gargling are.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.010
Washing hands and gargling...

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:27.630
Bar soap... Hand soap...

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.390
Ah...

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.130
{=2}Medicine

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.130
{=1}Star Drugs

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.770
Oh, and some compresses.

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:36.140
Welcome!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.230
Loxonun Tape

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.150
Uramichi Oniisan!

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:43.820
Coming!

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:47.110
Do you believe in God?

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.910
I don't.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:55.950
Haven't you felt things like anxieties,
worries, and regrets in your life?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.960
Yes, all the time.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:01.210
God saves you from those things.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.340
Is that true?

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:06.470
Yes, if you believe in God from
the bottom of your heart, he surely will!

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:08.880
When I can't even believe in myself?

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:11.760
What? Well... um...

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.140
I have to go to work now, so...

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:17.480
E-Excuse me...
If you don't mind me asking...

