00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:54.420
No matter what I'm doing, there are
times I suddenly wonder things like,

00:14:54.420 --> 00:15:01.000
"What am I doing?" or "Is this really
what I should be doing right now?"

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:24.320
Nothing changes in society regardless
of where I am or what I'm doing.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:25.820
Ow!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:30.200
And when I have these feelings
that I'm clearly wasting time,

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.580
I feel guilty about what
I'm doing to myself.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.960
But then, I don't even know how
to make meaningful use of my time.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:42.760
I really don't know...
how to live anymore.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:45.220
Then at least...

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:49.300
...I don't want this time
to end up being wasted.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.100
I want my efforts to be rewarded.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.110
Hm?

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:01.860
Morning!

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:04.690
Where's Uramichi-<i>san</i>?

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:07.570
I heard he's sleeping in that room
after pulling an all-nighter.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.320
What? Seriously?! Let's go check it out!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.620
You know, that's your problem.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.870
G'morning!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.540
Whoa... He really is sleeping.

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.420
This is rar--

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:28.590
Awak-- Awak-- Is he dead?!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.340
I'm still alive.

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.640
Of course!

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:35.890
I forgot that I can't sleep much
without sleeping pills or booze.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.980
I'll go take a shower.

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:40.190
Usahara.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:42.560
My efforts will be rewarded today.

