I wonder where Usao-<i>kun </i>went.

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:56.410
Moan... Moan...

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.750
Oh, there he is!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:16:59.790
What's wrong?

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.670
I fell and hurt myself, hop.

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:03.540
If we don't do anything,
it'll be a problem, <i>kuma</i>!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:04.960
Okay.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:09.970
Well then, kids. Let's call out
to our hero Jerminator together!

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.260
One, two...!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.390
Jerminator!

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:14.680
Here I am!

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:19.890
If you're having trouble,
leave it to me, Jerminator!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.400
So, who got injured?

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:25.570
I did, hop! The wound
will get infected, hop!

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:27.900
Then, before I put a bandage on it,
let's disinfect the wound!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:29.570
"Makiran"

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.030
Stop right there!

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:30.240
Hm?!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.160
