I'm glad you asked.

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.590
These are my clones, Mini-Bacterians!

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:45.670
Mini-Bacterians?!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.880
Because my feelings are in them,
each one of them has a sense of self.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:49.920
Sense of self?!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:50.880
I'm hungry.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:51.300
I wanna eat a lot.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:53.470
--I wonder if I could win the lottery.
--My butt is kind of itching.

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:54.300
Cod roe.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:54.970
Hey, don't push me!

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:55.760
Pickled fish.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.390
You're right!
They've got a sense of self!

00:17:57.390 --> 00:17:59.310
I-In any case, give me
sanitizing soap bubbles!

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.390
"Soap Bubbles"
"Rattle, rattle, rattle..."

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.600
You're wasting your time!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:04.060
I, Bacterian, don't lose every time!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.810
Go, Mini-Bacterians!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:07.190
Squish!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.400
Squish! Squish! Squish! Squish!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:12.240
Wh-What are these made of?!

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:14.660
What do you think they're made of?

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.990
How do you like that,
Bac--err, Jerminator!

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.290
Do you feel the weight of
the attack I spent all night on?!

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:21.080
He messed up again, didn't he?

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.870
Whisper

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.580
Th-They're absorbing my energy!

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:29.050
It feels like I'm being
consumed by negative feelings.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:33.680
I, Bac--err, Jerminator, lose today.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.600
I think I'll sleep well tonight!

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:39.010
What? He lost?

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:40.770
Is this what he meant by "rewarded"?

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:44.730
The good doesn't necessarily always win.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:45.940
Is this for real?

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.310
No way.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:51.650
They reshot the 
segment after this

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:50.980
They reshot the segment after this.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:42.470
Well then, I'll see you
next week! Good night!

