00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:46.930
I'm Pure Pink, the princess
who fights against evil!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.190
The villain this week is

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:52.060
a college man who thinks he's
a fashion leader even though he's not!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:55.980
He recommends an affiliate internet
business to his female <i>kohai</i>.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:21:00.360
The patronizing air he puts on is way
harder to deal with than a giant typhoon!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:03.580
We, the KiraPure, will protect
the peace of today's Japan!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:07.120
<i>KiraPure Aggressive </i>airs on Sundays
at eight in the morning.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:08.280
KiraPure Aggressive

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.330
I hope you watch it!

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.750
The proverb, "What one likes,
one will do well"...

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.380
I think it's very true.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.260
I never really wished
to be good at drawing.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:23.260
It's just that my feelings
of not wanting to draw

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:27.680
show up in the expressions
of the things that I draw.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:30.230
It feels unbearable.

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:34.190
You over there!
Look up and pay attention!

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:34.190
Hm?

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:35.730
Here is a psychological test!

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:40.150
"Psychological Test"

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:40.320
Please get a pen and paper
and try this test!

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:42.570
Home, a man and a woman, and an animal.

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.780
"Home" "Man and woman"

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:45.650
"Animal"
"Home" "Man and woman"

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:45.830
Please try drawing them on a sheet
of paper however you'd like.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:49.200
This psychological test will tell you
things about your aspirations,

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:53.210
love life, marriage, and your personality!

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:56.630
To be honest, I didn't really believe it.

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:58.300
But I tried taking the test.

00:21:58.300 --> 00:22:01.010
And it turned out that
they were exactly right!

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:03.090
Okay, time is up! Did you finish drawing?

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:07.140
Well then, let's see how you did!

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:10.730
First of all, if you drew a big house or
many houses, you're the type who brims

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:14.860
with ambition and aspirations towards
the future and will be successful.

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:18.110
If you drew a small house
or just one house...

00:22:18.110 --> 00:22:20.610
How should I put it...?
You might have a hard life.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:23.160
Please try harder! Moving on!

00:22:23.160 --> 00:22:25.280
If the man and the woman
you drew are smiling,

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:28.410
or if they're close to each other
and seem intimate,

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:32.210
you have an active love life
and are sociable with other people.

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:35.080
You're likely to have a happy marriage.

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:39.300
On the other hand, if you drew
them apart or with gloomy faces,

00:22:39.300 --> 00:22:44.380
your partner won't trust you since
you keep your distance from them.

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:47.760
In terms of marriage, it's also
hopeless for you. I'm sorry!

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:51.890
It might be better if you try
getting used to being alone.

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:54.100
The last is the animal drawing.

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:57.610
Surprisingly, it has nothing to do
with what kind of animal you drew.

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:01.070
If you drew a dog, the test is whether
or not others can tell it's a dog.

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:04.030
This shows if you have
personality issues or not.

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:06.280
If they can't tell, you are...

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:06.910
"I'll check it next time I go back."
Well... I hate to tell you this,

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:06.900
"More importantly, would you
like to go out for a drink now?"

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:08.700
"Today"

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:08.700
Well... I hate to tell you this,

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:10.030
"What does this look like to you?"
Well... I hate to tell you this,

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:13.370
but disappointing as a person.

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:18.670
You might be the type who people don't
want to be friends with... possibly...

00:23:18.670 --> 00:23:20.210
I feel for you.

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:45.530
"Uramichi, Kumatani, etc."
"What does this look like to you?"

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:48.190
"Uramichi, Kumatani, etc."
"A mole?"
"A chupacabra?"

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:50.910
It's a dog!
